8:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Stop the 11pm Founder Spiral: Diagnose Landing Page Leaks Fast\",\"description\":\"It's 11:47pm and you've refreshed Ads Manager three times. You're not looking for data. You're looking for reassurance. Here's what's actually happening - and what your page is silently doing while you spiral.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-25\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/the-11pm-founder-spiral\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent","children":"Landing Page Leaks"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-4xl","children":"Stop the 11pm Founder Spiral: Diagnose Landing Page Leaks Fast"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"It's 11:47pm. You've refreshed Ads Manager three times in the last twenty minutes. The numbers haven't changed. You know they haven't changed. You're not looking for data - you're looking for something that tells you it's going to be okay. That's the spiral. And it's lying to you about where the problem actually is."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-the-11pm-founder-spiral&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L19",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-fg","children":"This Is What the Midnight Refresh Loop Actually Is"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The loop isn't about curiosity. It isn't analysis. It's a compulsion dressed up as diligence. You open the dashboard because sitting with uncertainty feels worse than doing something - anything - even if that something is just staring at a cost-per-click that hasn't moved since 9pm."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"What you're actually feeling at 11:47pm is a specific kind of dread: the suspicion that something is broken and you can't see it. Not the campaign. The page. The thing the campaign sends people to. You can feel it in your gut even when the dashboard gives you nothing to point at."}],"$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]]}],null,"$L21"]}]
